\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Praise to the living God !
\par All praised be His name,
\par Who was, and is, and is to be,
\par For aye the same !
\par The One Eternal God
\par Ere aught that now appears :
\par The First, the Last, beyond all thought 
\par His timeless years !
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Formless, all lovely forms
\par Declare His loveliness;
\par Holy, no holiness of earth 
\par Can His express,
\par Lo, He is Lord of all !
\par Creation speaks His praise,
\par And everywhere, above below, 
\par His will obeys.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. His Spirit floweth free,
\par High surging where it will :
\par In prophet's word He spake of old,
\par He speaketh still.
\par Established is His Law,
\par And changeless it shall stand,
\par Deep writ upon the human heart,
\par On sea, on land.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Eternal life hath He
\par Implanted in the soul;
\par His love shall be our strength and stay,
\par While ages roll.
\par Praise to the living God !
\par All praised be His name,
\par Who was, and is , is to be,
\par For aye the same.       
\par                  Amen.\lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

